            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-5__amdact-1__item-30">
              <num>30</num>
              <heading>After subsection 6H(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-5__amdact-1__item-30__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-5__amdact-1__item-30__qstr-1__subsec-1A">
                  <num>1A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>A person must not, in response to a notice given to the person under subsection 2(3C) in connection with a Commission, intentionally give information or a statement that the person knows to be false or misleading with respect to any matter that is material to the inquiry being made by the Commission.</p>
                  </content>
